    "description": "<p><br> Boltrunians are a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Near-Human\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Near-Human\">Near-Human</a> Species that developed on the Outer Rim world, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Boltrunia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQm9sdHJ1bmlhP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Boltrunia</span>. The planet's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/High_Gravity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Gravity\">High Gravity</a> forced the Boltrunians to develop massive strength and endurance in order to survive and flourish. As a result, Boltrunian society is a perfect example of survival of the fittest, creating a people who respect pure strength and disdain weakness. Boltrunians have little compassion for those who cannot pull their weight and will often leave weak and infirm to their deaths.</p>",
